<title>BELGIUM: EU 1997/98 economic forecasts for Ireland.</title>
<headline>EU 1997/98 economic forecasts for Ireland.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic forecasts by the European Commission for Ireland, released on Wednesday:</p>
<p>				     1997	 1998</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		 7.2	  6.6</p>
<p> Investment			 7.5	  7.0</p>
<p> GDP price deflator (pct)     2.0	  2.5</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	    11.7	 11.3</p>
<p> Public sector deficit	  1.0	  1.2</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)</p>
<p> Debt/GDP ratio		  68.3	 64.3</p>
</text>
